<title>FRANCE: EU approves national food aid shipments.</title>
<headline>EU approves national food aid shipments.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday approved the following food aid shipment organised by member states, grain trade sources said. WFP indicates that the food is for delivery through the United Nations' World Food Programme.</p>
<p> Supplier Destination	Product     Tonnage   Shipment</p>
<p> France   Iraq (WFP)	 Soft wheat  3,000     April</p>
<p> France   Mauritania (WFP) Wheat flour 1,460     April</p>
<p> France   Liberia (WFP)    Wheat flour 2,190     April</p>
<p> France   Mauritania	 Soft wheat  3,000     Apr 22-May 9</p>
<p> France   Bulgaria	   Soft wheat  5,000     From Apr 17</p>
<p> Greece   Ethiopia/</p>
<p>	    Eritrea/</p>
<p>	    Djibouti/</p>
<p>	    Armenia	    Durum	 5,000     1997</p>
</text>
